repository-code: https://github.com/sparkainlp-x
abstract: >-
  A falsifiable classical toy implementing the deep-research
  protocol for "crystallizing microtubules": a 13x12 lattice
  pattern with a seam, Hebbian subspace crystallization,
  outer-product recall, a Youden's-J refusing gate, a
  commit-sample-revise calibration game, a Kuramoto phase
  layer, and the controls that separate generic memory
  success from lattice-specific success. Stdlib-only.
keywords:
  - holographic-memory
  - hebbian-learning
  - crystallization
  - microtubule-lattice
  - calibration
  - falsification
